        <div Class='NewsTitle'>Velk is such a tease. What do we do with teases ?</DIV>
        <BR>
        Well, we were going to take down Trak, but he was camped, so we went down to VL and lo and behold, our buddy Velk was up. <BR><BR>Having so many casters in the guild we figured we'd get some uber lewtz for em.<BR><BR>Anyhow, this was my first experience as a GB enabled wizzie and let me tell you... I loved it.<BR><BR>Well, first try, we're very organized, and the guild is doing great in aggro control, but we lose a cleric to LD at a bad time...<BR><BR>Well, I was one of the last to die on that first attempt, and here's a screenshot of him as I died. What a tease !<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Velk022002/velkwipeout.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Well, we rezzed, and before he were ready again, oops, he's on us hehe, oh well, at least he was at 25% or so, and we prevailed...<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Velk022002/velkdead.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Woot !<BR><BR>Lewts were really nice, <BR><BR>Grats me on my Vermilion Robe of Torrefaction :<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><FONT color=white><TABLE WIDTH='323' HEIGHT='142'><TR><TD class='itemFont' bgcolor='black' ><FONT color=white>Vermilion Robe of Torrefaction<BR>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  NO DROP  <BR>AC: 15<BR>INT: +10  HP: +40  MANA: +75  SV FIRE: +25  <BR>WT:  1.0<BR>Effect: Conflagration <BR>Class:  WIZ  <BR>Race:   ALL<BR></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Grats Nadwen on Gloves of Bladecalling :<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><FONT color=white><TABLE WIDTH='323' HEIGHT='142'><TR><TD class='itemFont' bgcolor='black' ><FONT color=white>Gloves of Bladecalling<BR>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  NO DROP  <BR>AC: 2<BR>STA: +5  INT: +5  MANA: +50  <BR>WT:  0.0<BR>Effect: Sword of Runes <BR>Class:  MAG  <BR>Race:   ALL<BR></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Grats Quagmire on his uber UBER Bracelet of Frostbite:<BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><FONT color=white><TABLE WIDTH='323' HEIGHT='142'><TR><TD class='itemFont' bgcolor='black' ><FONT color=white>Bracelet of Frostbite<BR>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <BR>HP: +30  SV COLD: +9  <BR>WT:  0.0<BR>Class:  MAG  WIZ  ENC  NEC  <BR>Race:   ALL<BR></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>And finally grats Azzule on Velketor's Spell Book:<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><FONT color=white><TABLE WIDTH='323' HEIGHT='142'><TR><TD class='itemFont' bgcolor='black' ><FONT color=white>Velketor's Spell Book<BR>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <BR>STA: +5  CHA: +5  INT: +8  MANA: +100  SV FIRE: +10  <BR>SV DISEASE: +5  SV COLD: +10  SV MAGIC: +20  <BR>SV POISON: +5  <BR>WT:  0.5<BR>Class:  MAG  WIZ  ENC  NEC  <BR>Race:  ERU  HUM  IKS  HIE  DEF  GNM  <BR></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>I had to log when the guild was headed to OS to kill Trak, so might have some news later =)<BR><BR> 
